{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Man vs. Machine"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "The Future Race"}, {"type": "position", "content": 10}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 5}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Explain about technology and technical problems in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Modal Verbs for Speculation"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<p>You can use modals to talk about degrees of certainty.</p>You use them to describe what is definite, probable, possible, or impossible from the speaker's point of view."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use <span class=\"italic\">must</span>, <span class=\"italic\">may</span>, <span class=\"italic\">might</span>, and <span class=\"italic\">could</span> to describe degrees of certainty."}, {"type": "text", "content": "In the affirmative, there is no difference between <span class=\"italic\">can</span>, <span class=\"italic\">may</span> and <span class=\"italic\">might</span>. They mean that maybe it will happen."}, {"type": "text", "content": "In the negative, <span class=\"italic\">can't</span> expresses the opposite. It means this most likely will not happen."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Modal</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">This number can only grow in the future.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"maybe they will grow in the future\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Bioartificial organs might change transplanting forever.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"maybe they will change transplanting forever\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Soon this may become commonplace.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"maybe they will become commonplace\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Bionic can't be the only answer.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"this is most likely the only answer\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "In the future, people who need a body part might be able to have parts regrown or 3D printed in a lab from their own cells."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Biological structures made with 3D technology from digital files may soon be accessible."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You could start with a 3D printing course at college, online, or even at your local library."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking about Wishes and Imaginary Situations"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<p>You use <span class=\"italic\">wish</span> to talk about things you do not have/do or cannot have/do.</p>You use the second conditional to talk situations that are possible, but not likely."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Wishes can be expressed in the affirmative, negative and interrogative forms:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Second Conditional</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Affirmative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">All hospitals wish they had easy access to  healthy organs.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Interrogative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Wish you could be on the cutting edge of this new technology?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Negative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">No one wishes they needed a transplant.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you needed an organ, it would have to be closely matched to you."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If the match wasn't close enough, your immune system could reject it."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Wouldn't everyone wish they could have the new organ they needed, produced from their own cells?"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "organ"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "part of a body"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Organs are now being grown in labs."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le05ob10aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about the future of organ replacement."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "closely"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "in a close or direct way"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Organs have to be closely matched to the patient receiving them."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le05ob10aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to match"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to be similar"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: When organs don't match the body can reject them."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le05ob10aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "immune system"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the biological function that protects us from disease"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Our immune system helps us fight off disease."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le05ob10aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "co